WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.233 --> 00:00:08.595
the residents of Greenwood Forest were excited.

2
00:00:09.796 --> 00:00:11.057
Spring was finally here.

3
00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:14.479
The weather was warm, and the flowers were blooming.

4
00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:17.382
"Chirp, chirp, chirp!

5
00:00:18.243 --> 00:00:19.544
Spring is here!

6
00:00:19.804 --> 00:00:21.245
Spring is here!

7
00:00:22.566 --> 00:00:23.427
Chirp, chirp, chirp!"

8
00:00:24.408 --> 00:00:25.268
sang out Rosie.

9
00:00:25.288 --> 00:00:29.252
"Hey, it's my turn to announce spring!

10
00:00:29.692 --> 00:00:31.193
You did it last year!"

11
00:00:31.913 --> 00:00:34.074
cried Maggie, Rosie's twin sister.

12
00:00:35.575 --> 00:00:38.056
Old friends were sharing stories about the winter.

13
00:00:38.076 --> 00:00:42.157
"It was the most awful winter of my life!"

14
00:00:43.158 --> 00:00:44.418
cried Sandy the squirrel.

15
00:00:44.438 --> 00:00:50.201
"Some days I couldn't find a single nut to give to my children."

16
00:00:51.481 --> 00:00:53.842
New friends were also moving into the forest.

17
00:00:53.862 --> 00:00:56.603
"Hello, everyone.

18
00:00:57.144 --> 00:00:58.044
I'm Rhoda.

19
00:00:58.556 --> 00:01:02.879
These are my children, Kit and Katie," said Rhoda the rabbit.

20
00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:07.042
All the animals and birds in Greenwood welcomed Rhoda's family.

21
00:01:07.062 --> 00:01:13.127
"You're just in time to see Bella," said Henrietta the old owl.

22
00:01:13.147 --> 00:01:15.769
"Who's Bella?"

23
00:01:16.549 --> 00:01:17.130
asked Katie.

24
00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:25.756
"Bella is a bear, and she is coming out of her hibernation," answered Pinkey the snake.

25
00:01:27.456 --> 00:01:30.078
"Hibernation? What does that mean?"

26
00:01:30.518 --> 00:01:30.999
asked Kit.

27
00:01:31.019 --> 00:01:32.900
"Come along.

28
00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:36.743
You can ask Bella yourself," said Henrietta.

29
00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:39.845
"Yes, let us hurry.

30
00:01:40.365 --> 00:01:44.968
We want to welcome Bella when she comes out of her cave," said Sandy.

31
00:01:46.089 --> 00:01:52.334
The residents of Greenwood skipped, hopped, crawled, flew, and jumped to the entrance of a dark cave.

32
00:01:53.654 --> 00:01:55.536
Everyone stood and waited quietly.

33
00:01:56.788 --> 00:01:58.629
Suddenly there was a loud roar!

34
00:02:04.253 --> 00:02:06.795
I'm scared," cried Katie.

35
00:02:06.815 --> 00:02:09.217
"Don't worry, dear.

36
00:02:09.897 --> 00:02:11.678
That's just Bella yawning.

37
00:02:12.119 --> 00:02:14.700
She's been sleeping for a long time."

38
00:02:16.241 --> 00:02:17.222
Henrietta chuckled.

39
00:02:18.403 --> 00:02:19.664
The ground began to shake.

40
00:02:20.264 --> 00:02:21.345
Thump! Thump!

41
00:02:21.845 --> 00:02:27.600
Thump! A big brown bear with sleepy eyes poked her head out of the cave.

42
00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:32.402
"Bella!" cheered her friends.

43
00:02:34.282 --> 00:02:36.783
"Oh, is it springtime already?"

44
00:02:37.303 --> 00:02:38.403
Bella asked sleepily.

45
00:02:38.423 --> 00:02:42.905
"Yes! It's springtime!

46
00:02:43.025 --> 00:02:44.145
It's springtime!"

47
00:02:45.125 --> 00:02:45.825
chirped Maggie.

48
00:02:47.546 --> 00:02:49.987
Bella stood on her feet and stretched her body.

49
00:02:50.987 --> 00:02:53.027
She was very tall and very big!

50
00:02:56.032 --> 00:02:57.012
"Who are they?

51
00:02:57.493 --> 00:03:01.814
Hello. I don't think I know you," Bella said to Rhoda.

52
00:03:03.615 --> 00:03:04.776
"I'm Rhoda Rabbit.

53
00:03:05.216 --> 00:03:08.657
We just moved into Greenwood Forest," said Rhoda.

54
00:03:08.677 --> 00:03:12.139
"These are Kit and Katie, my children."

55
00:03:12.159 --> 00:03:14.780
"Don't be frightened!

56
00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:21.563
I promise I won't eat you, even though I am very hungry," Bella said with a smile.

57
00:03:22.763 --> 00:03:31.010
Katie poked her head out and said timidly, "What does hibernation mean?"

58
00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:36.712
"Winter is very cold, and it is hard to find food.

59
00:03:37.212 --> 00:03:42.354
So bears, like me, eat a lot of food right before winter comes.

60
00:03:42.795 --> 00:03:49.497
Then, when winter arrives, we go into our caves or trees and rest," answered Bella.

61
00:03:49.517 --> 00:03:53.359
"Do you sleep the whole time?"

62
00:03:53.999 --> 00:03:55.900
asked Kit, hiding behind her mother.

63
00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.563
"We sleep a lot, but not the whole time.

64
00:03:59.983 --> 00:04:02.085
We don't like to move very much.

65
00:04:02.546 --> 00:04:07.730
Otherwise our bodies might want to wake up, and we would get hungry again.

66
00:04:09.251 --> 00:04:16.138
As long as we stay still, our heart beat becomes very slow, and our body temperature drops lower

67
00:04:16.198 --> 00:04:17.979
than normal," answered Bella.

68
00:04:17.999 --> 00:04:21.282
"It keeps us from getting hungry too soon."

69
00:04:24.204 --> 00:04:26.425
"How long do you hibernate?"

70
00:04:26.926 --> 00:04:27.506
asked Katie.

71
00:04:27.526 --> 00:04:34.169
"Usually from the beginning of October until springtime," answered Bella, smiling.

72
00:04:34.189 --> 00:04:38.632
"Are you the only one who hibernates?"

73
00:04:39.032 --> 00:04:40.513
asked Kit, still hiding.

74
00:04:40.533 --> 00:04:46.856
"Frogs, bats, and snakes hibernate as well," answered Bella.

75
00:04:47.957 --> 00:04:49.458
Kit and Katie were amazed.

76
00:04:50.678 --> 00:04:53.340
They had never met someone who had slept for so long!

77
00:04:54.704 --> 00:04:58.647
"Thank you all for welcoming me into spring," said Bella.

78
00:05:00.148 --> 00:05:02.470
"It's good to see you, Bella!"

79
00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:03.570
cried her friends.

80
00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:08.494
"Well, the welcome party is over," said Henrietta.

81
00:05:08.514 --> 00:05:13.437
"Spring is here, and we have a lot of work to do."

82
00:05:13.457 --> 00:05:16.840
"Work?" asked Katie.

83
00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:18.621
"Of course.

84
00:05:19.342 --> 00:05:25.317
Now that the sunshine is here and the weather is warmer, we must prepare for next winter, before

85
00:05:25.357 --> 00:05:27.517
it gets cold again," said Sandy.

86
00:05:27.537 --> 00:05:33.799
"Don't worry," chuckled Bella, seeing the gloomy expressions on the rabbits' faces.

87
00:05:34.839 --> 00:05:36.840
"We will have lots of fun too."

88
00:05:39.161 --> 00:05:43.462
The animals returned to the center of the forest, looking for food along the way.

89
00:05:44.322 --> 00:05:50.844
As they left, they shouted to Rhoda, Kit, and Katie, "Welcome to Greenwood Forest!"

90
00:05:52.216 --> 00:05:53.537
"Thank you!"

91
00:05:54.377 --> 00:05:55.317
the rabbits replied.

92
00:05:55.337 --> 00:06:00.519
"I guess we had better go too," said Rhoda.

93
00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:04.501
And they hopped off to find a burrow in their new forest.

94
00:06:04.521 --> 00:06:07.542
"Spring is here!

95
00:06:07.742 --> 00:06:08.663
Spring is here!"

96
00:06:09.383 --> 00:06:10.063
chirped Maggie.

97
00:06:10.083 --> 00:06:12.785
"No, it's my turn!

98
00:06:13.485 --> 00:06:14.445
It's springtime!

99
00:06:14.465 --> 00:06:15.726
It's springtime!"

100
00:06:17.026 --> 00:06:18.267
Rosie shouted happily.

101
00:06:18.707 --> 00:06:21.048
The two birds flew off into the sunshine.
